00:31:13.230 --> 00:31:15.390
to give you a quick
step-by-step guide on how

00:31:15.390 --> 00:31:17.870
to create scheduled snapshot.

00:31:17.870 --> 00:31:18.370
[INAUDIBLE]

00:31:18.370 --> 00:31:18.953
SPEAKER 1: Hi.

00:31:18.953 --> 00:31:20.630
